# Lieutenant Hikaru Sulu's costs and its target. {2}{G} needs green: three mana of other colors with no green source anywhere
# cannot pay it. The ability's "target creature" is no land, so with {2}{U} in the pool the land is refused and not a point of
# mana spent. {2}{U} needs blue too: with the blue sources tapped out and spent and three nonblue mana in the pool, the
# activation cannot start.

